  "body": "The Best Backyard in Auckland: Experience the Long Bay Effect\r\n\r\nElevate your lifestyle with this stunning new pavilion-style home by David Reid Homes, perfectly situated in Long Bay's exclusive Green View development. Combining modern design, spacious interiors, and unbeatable coastal living, this 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home is set on a 435m² lot, offering everything you need to create your dream lifestyle.\r\n\r\nImagine waking up to the sound of waves and having a backyard that stretches into a regional park and marine reserve. This is the Long Bay effect - a lifestyle blending natural beauty with the convenience of modern living.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nPrime Coastal Living: Enjoy direct access to Long Bay Beach, the regional park, and the vibrant new village centre.\r\nArchitecturally Designed: 198m² of open-plan living, thoughtfully crafted for functionality and style.\r\nPeace of Mind: Backed by a comprehensive Master Builders guarantee.\r\nVillage Convenience: Walking distance to boutique cafes, bars, and eateries in the Long Bay village.\r\nZoned for Excellence: Located within the catchment of the highly regarded Long Bay College.\r\nExclusive Development: A unique opportunity to join the Green View community with pricing starting from $895k for sections ranging from 400m² to 1,200m².\r\n\r\nDiscover the lifestyle you've always dreamed of, combining tranquility and convenience, with the flexibility to build a future tailored to your family's needs.\r\n\r\nPlease copy and paste the below hyperlink to view the David Reid Homes website:\r\nwww.davidreidhomes.co.nz\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on this exceptional opportunity to secure your slice of paradise in Auckland's most sought-after coastal neighbourhood. Contact Dean or Jamie today to learn more and start your journey to living the Long Bay effect.",
